_Field_sprite.png","caption":"Вид поля","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/2d/2def7973619b7ed0e407.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Leopatchi_Paradise_sprite.png","caption":"Спрайт крупным планом · Tamagotchi Paradise","sprite":true}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-paradise-cd150b","title":"Tamagotchi Paradise","ru":"Tamagotchi Paradise","kind":"device","note":""}]}